#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:5
#: 4781e9a4f63840af9b78157550981b46
msgid "Hardware Options"
msgstr "硬件选项"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:7
#: c39c515c17f94e749d721af5c9e62f3e
msgid "This page lists the hardware required for an autonomous Balance Bot"
msgstr "本页列出了自主平衡机器人所需的硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:10
#: 844021c951fa450ab7ad5357cae51a1c
msgid "Frame"
msgstr "机架"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:12
#: 01af5a03c7544211ba210c3ae97a8931
msgid ""
"Any readily available or custom made frame suitable for Balance Bots can be "
"used. Ensure that there is sufficient space to hold all the components."
msgstr "可使用任何市售或定制的适用于平衡机器人的机架。确保有足够空间容纳所有组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:14
#: 91ef3b7836cc4cbc936b6db8b7e551c0
msgid ""
"For a 3d printable frame, check out :ref:`Arduroller<reference-frames-"
"arduroller>`."
msgstr "若需要 3D 打印机架，请参见 :ref:`Arduroller<reference-frames-arduroller>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:17
#: 486fbdf5542d4cc8a0bdd4b481f654c4
msgid "Autopilot"
msgstr "飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:19
#: 080eeadc86834408a91b925b3db08034
msgid ""
"The autopilot needs at least two PWM outputs for controlling the two motors "
"and four :ref:`GPIO pins<common-gpios>` to connect to two :ref:`wheel "
"encoders <wheel-encoder>`.  Some autopilots without an IOMCU will not have "
"enough GPIOs to support wheel encoders."
msgstr ""
"飞控至少需要两路 PWM 输出用于控制两个电机，以及四个 :ref:`GPIO 引脚 <common-gpios>` 用于连接两个 "
":ref:`车轮编码器 <wheel-encoder>`。某些没有 IOMCU 的飞控可能没有足够的 GPIO 来支持车轮编码器。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:22
#: 0a2fd71cb2ba4d0ea8229985673d605d
msgid "Motors and Wheel Encoders"
msgstr "电机与车轮编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:24
#: 3f640eb1c209458aa9b90cbf44c2d466
msgid ""
"The recommended solution is to use brushed motors with built-in quadrature "
":ref:`wheel encoders <wheel-encoder>` but other motors may be used if "
"external encoders are attached to the motor shafts.  Note that only "
"quadrature encoders with two output pins are supported.  :ref:`Wheel "
"encoders <wheel-encoder>` allow faster and more precise control of each "
"wheel which greatly improves the vehicle's balance."
msgstr ""
"推荐使用内置正交式 :ref:`车轮编码器 <wheel-encoder>` "
"的有刷电机，但若在电机轴上安装了外部编码器，也可以使用其他电机。请注意，仅支持具有两个输出引脚的正交编码器。:ref:`车轮编码器 <wheel-"
"encoder>` 可以实现对每个车轮更快速、更精确的控制，从而大幅提升车辆的平衡性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:26
#: 458257be2a164881b6479fee4e9d2136
msgid ""
"Stepper Motors and motors that use UART/I2C interface are not currently "
"supported."
msgstr "目前不支持步进电机以及使用 UART/I2C 接口的电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:28
#: 0a62365ceb5446a7a242db3492815981
msgid ""
"Gear backlash is a problem with many geared dc motors and this can "
"negatively affect stability. It is recommended to use motors that are "
"specified to be zero-backlash or have very little backlash."
msgstr "齿轮间隙是许多齿轮直流电机的常见问题，会对稳定性产生负面影响。建议使用标称为零间隙或间隙极小的电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:31
#: 75899d221f29476a93a796f64b9708b0
msgid "ESCs/Motor Drivers"
msgstr "电调/电机驱动器"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:33
#: 86a7d297debd42c3813e2b902cea2af3
msgid ""
"A list of verified ESCs/motor drivers can be fouind on the :ref:`brushed "
"motors<common-brushed-motors>` page."
msgstr "经验证的电调/电机驱动器列表可在 :ref:`有刷电机 <common-brushed-motors>` 页面中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:36
#: 126ce5ad54ea4ae3817fb927bfac2c88
msgid "GPS + Compass"
msgstr "GPS + 罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:38
#: ae6e6468c17a48328949b94b404c423e
msgid ""
"A GPS+Compass module is recommended if the balance bot will be used outdoors"
" in autonomous modes (e.g. Auto, Guided, RTL).  A compass is required so the"
" vehicle can estimate its heading.  For more details on supported GPS "
"hardware, refer to the :ref:`GPS/Compass page<common-positioning-landing-"
"page>`."
msgstr ""
"若平衡机器人将在户外以自主模式（如 Auto、Guided、RTL）运行，建议使用 GPS+罗盘模块。罗盘是车辆估算航向所必需的。有关支持的 GPS "
"硬件的详细信息，请参见 :ref:`GPS/罗盘页面 <common-positioning-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:41
#: 77e758d66f8544b79441747898b4630a
msgid "Telemetry Radio(optional)"
msgstr "数传电台（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-hardware.rst:43
#: b90fc24f58694b71ada1188492be74e2
msgid ""
"Telemetry radios are very useful for tuning and debugging. For more "
"information on supported hardware options refer :ref:`telemetry<common-"
"telemetry-landingpage>` page."
msgstr ""
"数传电台对于调参和调试非常有用。有关支持的硬件选项的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`数传 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` "
"页面。"
